(1, 'PRODUCT-0001', 'Insulated Glass', 'prod_6a37112f23635_1781993775.jpg', 7, 1, 'Laurel Insulated Glass is a window system consisting of two or more panes of glass separated by a sealed space filled with air or an insulating gas like argon. This design slows heat transfer, which improves energy efficiency, reduces heating and cooling costs, and provides better sound insulation. It\'s also known as an insulated glass unit (IGU) and helps reduce condensation.', 17.00, 2.00, 2300.00, 3000.00, 'pcs', 1, '2026-06-20 22:16:15', '2026-06-26 14:37:23'),
